Package: aobview
Title: View 'sf' and 'terra' Data in Their Own Coordinate Reference System
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Sumner", , "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A convenience front end for 'allonboard' map scenes: 'view(x)'
    draws spatial objects in a self-contained HTML page, in their own
    coordinate reference system or a polar view chosen for them, through
    the lean core package 'aobcore'. This is an early skeleton; the package
    name is a placeholder.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/allboa/aobview
BugReports: https://github.com/allboa/aobview/issues
